            "key": "news-1",
            "type": "post",
            "title": "10 scholarships international students often miss",
            "excerpt": "Many scholarships go unclaimed every year. Here are ten worth checking before you apply.",
            "content": "<p>Many scholarships go unclaimed every year. Here are ten worth checking before you apply.</p><h2>Start early</h2><p>The earlier you begin, the more options you have. Make a short list, note the deadlines and ask an advisor to check your plan.</p><h2>Ask for help</h2><p>Our advisors are happy to help — the service is free for students.</p>",
            "image": "news-1",
            "category": "Scholarships",
            "date": "{{date:-2 days}}"
        },
